# k6 run output. The harness and its budget are source; individual run results
# are measurements of one machine on one day and must never be mistaken for the
# contracted acceptance evidence. CI archives them as build artefacts instead.
perf/k6/.results/*
!perf/k6/.results/.gitkeep

# Ansible: vendored Galaxy collections and the fact cache. Both are reproduced
# from requirements.yml — see docs/ansible.md.
infra/ansible/collections/
infra/ansible/.facts/
# Real inventories name real machines, and hostnames of this platform are
# themselves sensitive. Only inventories/example/ is committed.
infra/ansible/inventories/*
!infra/ansible/inventories/example/
